{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:63c4abc18843696c","name":"PLX-2M Portable Missile Launcher","source":{"id":"source:reference-63c4abc18843696c","title":"PLX-2M Portable Missile Launcher","revision":20730,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:24:33Z","sha256":"b0136db2b3af8ee48c1232a6a9a82a38040af0035b8e77a86c744944ff589c2a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20730","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=PLX-2M%20Portable%20Missile%20Launcher&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-63c4abc18843696c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The shoulder-mounted PLX-2M is derived from Merr-Sonn's Clone Wars-era PLX-1 Portable Missile Launcher. Designed to punch holes through heavy armor, the \"Plex-Twoem\" is also a particularly effective antipersonnel weapon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The PLX-2M can be fired in direct mode, or it can be fired in heat-seeking mode or gravity-activated mode (providing a -2 penalty to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of all targets of a particular type: artillery, character, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},"). The miniature proton warheads in the PLX-2M's Arakyd 3t3 Missile detonate on impact, damaging all targets within a 3-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," with a PLX-2M, you make a single attack roll and compare the result to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target in the weapon's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Burst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Burst"}," radius. Creatures you hit take full damage, and creatures you miss take half damage. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The PLX-2M Portable Missile Launcher holds six Arakyd 3t3 Missiles and can be reloaded as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". Replacement Missiles are available in packs of six, costing 350 credits and weighing 8 kg. The PLX-2M weighs 48 kg, but because of the launcher's built-in microrepulsorlift, the weapon does not count against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Encumbrance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Encumbrance","referenceId":"reference:7c0376ae0ea9eee1"}," when it is carried as a character's active, drawn weapon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Large\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 2,250\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 8d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 48 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
